# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the context root's, so this
# keeps a multi-GB laptop checkout (node_modules, target/) out of the build context.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.DS_Store
**/.local
Signal-Desktop-Persona-main/bundles
Signal-Desktop-Persona-main/release
Signal-Desktop-Persona-main/build/compact-locales
Signal-Desktop-Persona-main/packages/personas-engine/*.node
# Laptop configs carry a machine-specific CA and 127.0.0.1 URLs; the entrypoint writes its own.
Signal-Desktop-Persona-main/config/local-*
crypto_personas
experiments
json_files
